# Fresh private profile; this writes Show shellbar through its real Settings row.
# For a retained causal export set TURNSTONE_DIAGNOSTIC_RECORDS=65536 and
# TURNSTONE_DIAGNOSTIC_BYTES=33554432; counters still report bounded join losses.
settle 20
key escape
resize 1180 950
open mere://settings-reactive
settle 10
act Open Settings pane
settle 5
assert pane turnstone.settings
act Maximize pane
settle 4
scroll 800 450 10000
settle 4
capture 01_settings_before_apply
click surface:settings .toggle
settle 2
click surface:settings .setting-apply @data-setting=chrome.shellbar.visible
settle 8
capture 02_settings_after_apply
log Settings Apply completed for reactive diagnostic qualification
